orrect!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le11ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You must have finished with all the bureaucratic garbage you have had to deal with over the last week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know I may have spent four or five full days running around, making reports, signing forms and being passed from one person to another. If only I had reported it earlier.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You shouldn't have done so much online shopping. It must have happened because of that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We all have done things we shouldn't have done. Like, I shouldn't have given Kevin that loan. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You loaned someone money!? Ha!", "id": 1, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le11ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  What would you have done? It was a while back. I got some tax money back and my high-school buddy Kevin needed rent money. He would have been kicked out and then he would have been asking to live with me if I hadn't lent it to him.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I still think you must have been crazy to lend it to him. I imagine you're not friends anymore.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, we still hang out. I think after Kevin must have thought I would lend him money because he always asks. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Never lend a friend money. You are too forgiving, Peter. You haven't asked him to pay you back? Gosh, I feel like I should have lent you money when you asked.", "id": 2, "time": "32000", "image": "engenn9le11ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You could have lent it to me, but I have a car instead, and that's pretty cool!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: All this money talk is making me nervous. I have bill payments and student loan payments coming up and I will be strapped for cash.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: At least we have good friends, right. We can just hang out and live on love.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds like something I'd say! And I agree, let's not worry about money now, let's just seize the moment!", "id": 3, "time": "68000", "image": "engenn9le11ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le11ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le11ob09re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}